>I haven't been playing nethack very long, but I finally am starting to get into
>so of the interesting stuff. Help if you can...
>I found a wand of wishing, so I zapped it.  It asked me what I wanted to wish
>for, so I type in "grey dragon scale".  I got leather armor!  What gives!

Your wording for wishes has to be very precise.  What you should have
asked for is a "gray dragon scale mail".  Or rather, "a blessed +2
gray dragon scale mail", since you don't risk anything by asking for a
blessed enchanted object.  The worst that could happen is that you'll
get a plain object.

